[{"client_msg_id":"c07db4c5-7a7d-4c36-80e9-c358a02844f0","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"資料を作る側はアピールする為に良く見える工夫が必要で、\n資料を見る側は見かけに騙されないように本質を見極める必要が有る、と。\n裏の取り合いだこれ。","ts":"1624631545.330200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2yji"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bc525c3-0870-4ea4-abdd-a6f55b59033c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"~そこで霞ヶ関フォーマット~","ts":"1624624281.328600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIblr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8E142EB8-661C-4C60-9B5D-60AB45341255","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ですねー。ただ、資料の見た目に騙されないために、VCとかの投資家プレゼンとかの資料は、テンプレの穴埋めにさせたほうが、資料の良し悪しに左右されずに判断できて良さそうとか思いました。","ts":"1624623855.328100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35e913db-5902-4ecb-93a2-bf7b89c3ff0f","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"内容そのものも勿論大事だけど、商談とかではやっぱ資料のぱっと見の見かけの良さもけっこう重要ですよね・・・","ts":"1624623179.325500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A621W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"324E1048-1BF6-41AE-9B84-90F0021B547D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"カッコいい資料を作ったのが良かったのかもしれません","ts":"1624607560.323700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":8,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U011FTGJ3SN","U7JL1UKKL","U782D5DF1","U9S4G0LJW","U776661HA","U013QL1RAPN","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EyLn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1BE55475-E148-415E-A863-9C22ED7F25AA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ビッグ提案がすんなり通って安心する同時にちょっと拍子抜けしました","ts":"1624607527.323100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_or